# Pathfinder-as-3.5e extension: class features referenced by the variants.
# Descriptive entries (no numeric mechanics) so sheets can name them.

Cloistered Cleric	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary	DESC:Lore (PF Cloistered Cleric): knowledge bonuses and extra skill points.
Weapon Training	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Fighter: +1 attack/damage with a chosen weapon group at 5th, improving every 4 levels.
Weapon Guard	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Fighter: +1 CMD/AC vs disarm and sunder at 9th, improving later.
Armor Training	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Fighter: reduce armor check penalty and raise max Dex at 3rd, improving every 4 levels.
Armor Mastery	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Fighter: DR 5/- while wearing armor at 19th, DR 10/- at 20th.
Arcane School	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:Wizard: specialist school with granted powers and opposed schools.
Arcane Bond	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Wizard: bond with an item or a familiar.
